#: home/templates/home/home_page.html:535
msgid ""
"I build solid, secure, growth-ready technology foundations so your business "
"can operate with confidence, stability, and high performance."
msgstr ""
"Construyo bases tecnológicas sólidas, seguras y preparadas para crecer, para "
"que tu negocio opere con confianza, estabilidad y alto rendimiento."

